            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Requests to the Mac app are no longer left waiting. Now and then a request (a key or a message passed on from a phone, a command from the command line) was not read for ten seconds and was then refused. The app now takes a request as soon as its line arrives.

Séance's settings file no longer grows. A dead copy of the window's size was written at every launch, about 1 MB after two months of use, and every settings change had to sort through them. They are removed at the first launch and no more are made.
]]></description>
